cated among the domestic architecture (Delougaz and Kantor 1975: 94). Associated with this platform was a building of substantial size. Another large building was represented by the remains of a thick buttressed wall (Delougaz and Kantor 1975: 95)." <br>'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2865, 'temperature': 0.2})
